  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Indicator",
    "type_designations": ["MATAS PB16", "MATAS P16B"],
    "description": "Indicating device designed to be used as part of a single/multi-interval, Class III or IIII, non-automatic weighing instrument. Self-indicating and mains-powered. The instruments are not designed for direct sales to the public. Main features: aluminium enclosure, LED display, operator keypad with 7 navigation and function keys, LED enunciators. Devices: initial zero setting device on power up, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing, gross/net/zero enunciators, indication of stable equilibrium, gravity compensation. Interfaces: load cell connection, RS232, USB printer, LAN. Software held in firmware with identification number SOFt 1.x; access to legally relevant parameters prevented by jumper JP1 on the main board. Any compatible R60-certified load cell may be used subject to compatibility of modules."
